e;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your health and do not overwork, lest you end up in the hospital;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in real estate and cars, increasing your level of comfort;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your company, having a controlling interest;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve success as a legal business \u2013 or get rich quickly engaging in shady activities; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of mini-games, including pachinko and horse racing betting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many other features and unexpected situations await you in <strong>STONKS-9800</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/737f260db7e6bf26507f5f80182f9620.apng?t=1769864648\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/737f260db7e6bf26507f5f80182f9620.poster.avif?t=1769864648\" class=\"bb_img\" width=42 height=88 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/deece3b62750412c0528e4b5a0fc9612.apng?t=1769864648\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/deece3b62750412c0528e4b5a0fc9612.poster.avif?t=1769864648\" class=\"bb_img\" width=42 height=88 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/20d7a5305d18eb13e9a72537c8ffef9b.apng?t=1769864648\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1539140/extras/20d7a5305d18eb13e9a72537c8ffef9b.poster.avif?t=1769864648\" class=\"bb_img\" width=38 height=60 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.ste